  "_comment": "Per-locale plural-form definitions used by the AI prompt and written into the .po header. Values follow standard gettext/WP conventions (see GlotPress). 'expr' is the Plural-Forms expression that goes into the .po header; 'nplurals' is the count of forms; 'rule' is a short human-readable explanation that gets injected into the AI prompt so the model knows what each f0/f1/... form should encode.",
